---
title: "claimTokenAllocation (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: check not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert_paused: paused
    q_revert_paused --> [*]: revert Paused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_supplied: not paused
    q_check_supplied --> q_check_claimed: tokensSupplied == true
    q_check_supplied --> q_revert_supply: tokens not supplied
    q_revert_supply --> [*]: revert TokensNotSupplied
    q_check_claimed --> q_verify_proof: position.hasSettled == false
    q_check_claimed --> q_revert_claimed: already claimed
    q_revert_claimed --> [*]: revert AlreadyClaimed
    q_verify_proof --> q_calc_alloc: verify merkle proof against claimMerkleRoot
    q_verify_proof --> q_revert_proof: invalid proof
    q_revert_proof --> [*]: revert InvalidMerkleProof
    q_calc_alloc --> q_check_vesting: determine immediate vs vested allocation
    q_check_vesting --> q_deploy_vesting: has vesting schedule
    q_check_vesting --> q_transfer_immediate: no vesting (immediate only)
    q_deploy_vesting --> q_transfer_vested: deploy LegionLinearVesting clone, transfer vested tokens
    q_transfer_vested --> q_transfer_immediate_partial: set position.vestingAddress
    q_transfer_immediate_partial --> q_finalize: transfer immediate portion to investor
    q_transfer_immediate --> q_finalize: transfer full allocation to investor
    q_finalize --> [*]: position.hasSettled = true, emit TokensClaimed

    note right of q_deploy_vesting
        INV-001: merkle proof must validate against published claimMerkleRoot
        INV-002: each investor can claim at most once
        INV-003: vesting contract deployed via EIP-1167 minimal proxy
        INV-004: total claimed tokens <= totalTokensAllocated
        INV-005: tokens must be supplied before claims are allowed
    end note
